OL,3,GNEWSATwo men sought after teenager
OL,4,Aseriously assaulted
OL,5,
OL,6,FImages have been released of two men
OL,7,Fpolice want to identify after a
OL,8,F19-year-old man was seriously
OL,9,Fassaulted.
OL,11,FDevon and Cornwall Police said the
OL,12,Fteenager was punched and kicked
OL,13,F"multiple times" while out with a
OL,14,Ffriend in Exeter during the early hours
OL,15,Fof 22 October.
OL,17,FHe was treated at the scene and then
OL,18,Ftaken to hospital after he suffered
OL,19,Fserious facial injuries, including a
OL,20,Fbroken nose and fractured eye socket,
OL,21,Fthe force said.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
